guides. Pulse owns task artifacts, approval gates, revisions and review severity.
The engine, hooks, agents, native-platform references and .impeccable state are
not part of this adaptation. Source paths and hashes are documented in
docs/design/impeccable-provenance.md in the plugin package.

The cultural method is Pulse-authored for the design-expression-assets cycle.
The film contribution adapts selected temporal-composition methods from
https://github.com/Tejashmakwana/motionmaxxing, Apache-2.0, source commit
8c8ec0f2a6f6c9a0da15cd24f7b1298ab298368c. No upstream runtime, media providers
or author-specific universal house policy is included. Additional source and
licence boundaries are recorded in docs/design/design-expression-provenance.md.

